      other people share through it.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      We may update these terms. When we do, we'll post the new version here and change the date
      above. Continuing to use Dipity after a change means you accept the new terms.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
